# Oak Park Construction — lead form delivery
#
# These are set in the Vercel project (Settings > Environment Variables), NEVER
# committed. Until all three of the required values exist, /api/enquiries answers
# 503 `config_pending` and the website falls back to opening the visitor's mail
# app, so a missing configuration can never silently swallow a lead.
#
# REQUIRED
# Where new enquiries are delivered. Any mailbox the business actually reads.
# Kept as configuration precisely so the recipient can change without a code
# change, and so no personal address is hard-coded into the site.
OPC_LEAD_TO=

# The Google Workspace account that sends the notification, and a Google
# App Password for it (not the account password). Create at
# https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords with 2-Step Verification enabled.
OPC_SMTP_USER=
OPC_SMTP_PASS=

# OPTIONAL
# Envelope From, if it should differ from OPC_SMTP_USER.
# OPC_LEAD_FROM=
# A second copy of every lead, e.g. a shared or archive mailbox.
# OPC_LEAD_BCC=
# Defaults below suit Google Workspace; override only for a different provider.
# OPC_SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# OPC_SMTP_PORT=465
